<h1>Kyler Murray Named Vikings Starting QB: <em>The Athletic Profile Behind the Comeback</em></h1>
<div class="meta-row">
<span>📖 7 min read</span>
<span>🏈 Football</span>
<span>🏟️ Breaking · Vikings</span>
</div>
<p class="dek">The Minnesota Vikings named Kyler Murray their starting quarterback over J.J. McCarthy on Tuesday, ending a competition that lasted barely two weeks of training camp. Murray famously skipped every athletic drill at his own combine — here's what his rushing production reveals instead, and how his path back from a torn ACL fits a familiar pattern.</p>
