<h2 id="mobility">What the Rushing Numbers Show</h2>
<p>Without a combine time to lean on, Murray's mobility shows up most clearly in his NFL production. In his last full, healthy season (2024), he rushed for 572 yards and five touchdowns to go with 3,851 passing yards and 21 passing touchdowns, completing 68.8% of his passes. His career on-target pass percentage of 77.0% ranks 11th among qualified passers since his 2019 debut, per Pro Football Reference — evidence that his game has never been pure scramble-and-improvise, even with the athletic profile driving the headlines.</p>
